cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use backlog in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "backlog: a real-time Union-Find decoder for quantum error correction, from simulation to FPGA"
abstract: >-
  An open-source weighted Union-Find decoder for the surface code, exact to a
  synchronous reference, with correlated (two-pass) decoding and the
  regularized reweighting rule, sliding and parallel window decoding for
  streaming, a predecoder, Stim and sinter integration, a VHDL implementation
  checked bit for bit against its model, and a browser demo of the algorithm.
authors:
